<title>JAPAN: Nichimen to buy back shares for stock option plan.</title>
<headline>Nichimen to buy back shares for stock option plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading house Nichimen Corp said on Monday that it would buy back up to 150,000 of its own shares, or 1.2 billion yen worth, in order to introduce a stock option scheme.</p>
</text>
